[M31_PA_VeryAngryBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Very Angry Bite"
LocLongDescription="Viciously bite any adjacent enemy, dealing <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_Damage> points of damage and causing bleeding. Costs a single action and doesn't the end the turn. Usable with movement-only action. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown."
LocHelpText="Viciously bite any adjacent enemy, dealing <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_Damage> points of damage and causing bleeding. Costs a single action and doesn't the end the turn. Usable with movement-only action."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Can be used with movement-only actions: <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_bAllowMovementActionPoint>.<br><Bullet> Counts as reaction fire: <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_bIsReactonFire>.<br><Bullet> Can crit (if not reaction fire or reaction fire is allowed to crit): <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_bAllowCrit>.<br><Bullet> Has +<Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_CritBonus> critical chance and <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_CritDamage> critical damage.<br><Bullet> Bleeding deals <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_BleedDamage> of the target's max HP (rounded up) damage per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_BleedDuration> turn(s).<br>"
LocFlyOverText="Very Angry Bite"

