LocLongDescription="Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_CrystallineCornea_AimBonus> aim and additional +<Ability:M31_PA_CrystallineCornea_FlankAimBonus> aim for melee and flanking attacks."
LocHelpText="Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_CrystallineCornea_AimBonus> aim and additional +<Ability:M31_PA_CrystallineCornea_FlankAimBonus> aim for melee and flanking attacks."
