LocLongDescription="Allows reaction attacks to crit and increases the soldier's critical chance by <Ability:M31_PA_MalevolentFocus_CritBonus>."
LocHelpText="Allows reaction attacks to crit and increases the soldier's critical chance by <Ability:M31_PA_MalevolentFocus_CritBonus>."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Allows all reaction attacks to crit.<br><Bullet> Critical chance bonus applies only to reaction attacks: <Ability:M31_PA_MalevolentFocus_bOnlyForReaction>."

[M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Paint the Moon Red"
LocLongDescription="Whenever you perform a melee attack, gain a stackable +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_DamagePerStack> damage bonus for your melee attacks for <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_StackDuration> turn(s). Can gain up to <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_MaxStacksPerTurn> stack(s) per turn and stacks up to <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_MaxStacks> times.<br><font color='#909497'>\"You can take the Taipan out of the Requiem, but you can't take the Requiem out of the Taipan.\"</font>"
LocHelpText="Whenever you perform a melee attack, gain a stackable +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_DamagePerStack> damage bonus for your melee attacks for <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_StackDuration> turn(s). Can gain up to <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_MaxStacksPerTurn> stack(s) per turn and stacks up to <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_MaxStacks> times."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Stacks up to <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_MaxStacks> times.<br><Bullet> Can gain up to <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_MaxStacksPerTurn> stack(s) per turn.<br><Bullet> New applications refresh the duration: <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_bRefreshDuration>.<br><Bullet> Applies only to <Ability:M31_BoundWeaponName> attacks: <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_bMatchSourceWeapon>.<br><Bullet> The bonus increases only on succesful hits: <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodThirst_bIncreaseOnlyOnHit>."
LocFlyOverText="Paint the Moon Red"

