[M31_PA_TaipanBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Vicious Bite"
LocLongDescription="Bite any enemy within blue movement range. Costs a single action and doesn't end the turn. Can be used with movement-only actions. Has a <Ability:M31_SelfCooldown> turn cooldown. Cannot target robots and environmental objects."
LocHelpText="Bite any enemy within blue movement range."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBite_Damage> points of damage and inflicts bleeding, causing the target to take <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_BleedDamage> of the target's max HP (rounded up) damage per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBite_BleedDuration> turn(s).<br><Bullet> Can crit for +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBite_CritDamage> damage.<br><Bullet> <Ability:M31_FriendlyName> has innate +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBite_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBite_CritBonus> critical chance.<br><Bullet> Cannot target robots and environmental objects."
LocFlyOverText="Vicious Bite"

[M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Deadly Bite"
LocLongDescription="Whenver an ally attacks a foe adjacent to the <Ability:ClassName>, follow up with a free bite attack. Take a free bite attack against any enemy that enters, exits or attacks from melee range during the enemy turn."
LocHelpText="Whenver an ally attacks a foe adjacent to the <Ability:ClassName>, follow up with a free bite attack. Take a free bite attack against any enemy that enters, exits or attacks from melee range during the enemy turn."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Deals <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite_Damage> damage and inflicts bleeding, causing the target to take <Ability:M31_PA_VeryAngryBite_BleedDamage> of the target's max HP (rounded up) damage per turn for <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBite_BleedDuration> turn(s).<br><Bullet> Can crit for +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite_CritDamage> damage if reaction fire is allowed to crit.<br><Bullet> <Ability:M31_FriendlyName> has innate +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite_CritBonus> critical chance.<br><Bullet> The chasing attack and the defensive attack can activate once per target per turn. The counter resets at the end of the target's turn.<br><Bullet> The chasing attack and the defensive attack can activate against the same target in a single turn: <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite_bExclusiveMark>.<br><Bullet> Only damaging input-triggered abilities are valid for the chasing attack. The chasing attack will not activate during the enemy turn.<br><Bullet> Will not activate while the <Ability:ClassName> is concealed."

[M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite_Attack X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Deadly Bite"
LocFlyOverText="Deadly Bite"

[M31_PA_TaipanDeadlyBite_ChaserAttack X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Deadly Bite"
LocFlyOverText="Deadly Bite"

[M31_PA_TaipanCruelty X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Terrifying Cruelty"
LocLongDescription="The <Ability:ClassName>'s direct attacks have a chance to panic enemies on critical hits. Increases the <Ability:ClassName>'s damage against stunned and panicking enemies by <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanCruelty_DamageBonusPrc>."
LocHelpText="The <Ability:ClassName>'s direct attacks cause the enemies to panic on critical hits. Increases the <Ability:ClassName>'s damage against stunned and panicking enemies by <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanCruelty_DamageBonusPrc>."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Panic can only apply to the primary target of the attack.<br><Bullet> The chance to panic is equal to <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanCruelty_BaseChance> - Will.<br><Bullet> Applies to all attacks regardless of the weapon."

[M31_PA_TaipanCruelty_Trigger X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Terrifying Cruelty"
LocFlyOverText="Terrifying Cruelty"

[M31_PA_TaipanVengeance X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Vengeful"
LocLongDescription="Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_CritBonus> critical chance against any enemy that attacks the <Ability:ClassName>. The bonus is doubled if the attack hit. Gain a partial bonus if the enemy attacks an ally instead. The <Ability:ClassName>'s overwatch can no longer be removed by damage."
LocHelpText="Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_AimBonus> aim and +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_CritBonus> critical chance against any enemy that attacks the <Ability:ClassName>. The bonus is doubled if the attack hit. Gain a partial bonus if the enemy attacks an ally instead. The <Ability:ClassName>'s overwatch can no longer be removed by damage."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> The bonus lasts indefinitely and can stack.<br><Bullet> The bonus applies only once per attack, even if the attack affects multiple allies.<br><Bullet> Attacks against allies give <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_AllyBonusModifierPrc> of the original bonus.<br><Bullet> Attacks against the Bondmate give the full bonus: <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_bTreatBondmateAsSelf>.<br><Bullet> The bonus applies only when the <Ability:ClassName> is attacked or can see the attacker or the attacked ally: <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_bRequireVisibility>.<br><Bullet> The bonus is applied for non-damaging hostile actions: <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanVengeance_bAnyHostileAction>."

[M31_PA_TaipanBloodHunter X2AbilityTemplate]
LocFriendlyName="Blood Hunter"
LocLongDescription="Increases the duration of <font color='#0bff9b'>Paint the Moon Red</font> by <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodHunter_BonusDuration> turn(s). Additionally, gain +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodHunter_CritBonusPerStack> critical chance for all attacks for each stack."
LocHelpText="Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodHunter_CritBonusPerStack> critical chance for all attacks for each stack of <font color='#0bff9b'>Paint the Moon Red</font>. <font color='#0bff9b'>Paint the Moon Red</font> lasts for <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodHunter_BonusDuration> additional turn(s)."
LocPromotionPopupText="<Bullet> Gain +<Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodHunter_CritBonusPerStack> critical chance for all attacks for each stack of <font color='#0bff9b'>Paint the Moon Red</font>.<br><Bullet> <font color='#0bff9b'>Paint the Moon Red</font> lasts for <Ability:M31_PA_TaipanBloodHunter_BonusDuration> additional turn(s)."

